; The in-process host against a loader that is not CompCert: [Gcc_loader] builds
; the same preprocessor-free unit into a shared object with the host compiler,
; loads it with dlopen and calls [entry] through ctypes. What is checked is the
; host: the entry adapter, the region layout, payload packing, repeated calls on
; one loaded unit, contexts, failure decoding. The CompCert loader is a thin
; adapter outside this suite.

